currentColor, round caps").
Source: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@1.34.0/icons/<name>.svg
License: ISC, see LICENSE-lucide (verbatim from
  https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@1.34.0/LICENSE)

lucide-icons.js
  sha256: f6f9455f29bdb3e4f90dd59020f0cf425aeea51cf4cd09dc27294e5f15485ac8

Not a redistributed upstream file: the 22 icons the design uses (circle,
circle-dot, package, user, link, play, square, pencil, copy, refresh-cw,
undo, trash-2, plus, chevron-down, download, folder, ban, search, list,
activity, sliders-vertical, circle-help) transcribed from those pinned SVGs
into a `{ name: [[svgTag, attrs], ...] }` map, so app.js can build them with
createElementNS and never touch innerHTML. Two deliberate edits to the
upstream path data: circle-dot's inner circle is r=3.2 filled (the design's
"circle-dot amber = running" needs a visible dot at 13px), and nothing else.
Regenerate by re-downloading the icons above and re-running the same
transcription.

